@startuml
autonumber

skinparam sequence {
ArrowColor gray
ActorBorderColor gray
LifeLineBorderColor black
}
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

participant "  合約院所  " as HOSP #d1ebf1
participant "  NIIS系統  " as NIIS #cadaa9

HOSP -> NIIS: 多筆或單筆之新增、修改、刪除檢驗結果\n(API: UpldExamRslt；格式：Bundle Request Reporting NIIS)
|||
alt 情況1：200 OK
    NIIS -> HOSP: 回覆新增、修改、刪除檢驗結果成功訊息\n(HTTP 200 OK；格式：Bundle Response NIIS)
else 情況2：400 Bad Request
    NIIS -> HOSP: 回覆新增、修改、刪除檢驗結果失敗訊息\n(HTTP 400 Bad Request；格式：OperationOutcome NIIS)
    |||
    HOSP -> HOSP: 異常資料修正
end
@enduml
